From 586bfd836b98aadc87ad4e30d65174ad4c9ac7a5
Subject: wasm: let the embedder supply the clipboard
Origin: https://github.com/robtfm/copypwasmta/commit/586bfd836b98aadc87ad4e30d65174ad4c9ac7a5
Date: 2026-09-24T10:18:11+01:00

A context without a `window` (a web worker, whose navigator has no
clipboard) cannot reach `navigator.clipboard`. `set_external_clipboard`
takes an async get and set that `WasmClipboardContext` calls instead,
e.g. functions that relay to the page.
